{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Uf.GlobalDomains</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"alt-ergo-lib","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"AltErgoLib","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Uf","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"GlobalDomains","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>This module provides a registry type to access and update a single &quot;current&quot; instance associated with multiple global domain types.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-t\"><a href=\"#type-t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> t</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Maps global domain modules (of type <code>'a global_domain</code>) to an associated domain of the corresponding type <code>'a</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-empty\"><a href=\"#val-empty\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> empty : <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>empty</code> maps all domain modules <code>D</code> to their default domain <code>D.empty</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-find\"><a href=\"#val-find\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> find : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-global_domain\">global_domain</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"type-var\">'a</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>find (module D) t</code> returns the global domain associated with the domain module <code>D</code>. Defaults to <code>D.empty</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-add\"><a href=\"#val-add\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> add : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-global_domain\">global_domain</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>add (module D) d t</code> registers the global domain <code>d</code> for the domain module <code>D</code>. Overwrite any pre-existing global domain associated with <code>D</code>.</p></div></div>"}